<title>SWEDEN: Securum sells Dutch property fund stake to VastNed.</title>
<headline>Securum sells Dutch property fund stake to VastNed.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish state-owned property manager Securum said on Monday it was selling its majority stake in Dutch property firm Pays-Bas Property Fund to VastNed Offices/Industrial N.V..</p>
<p>Securum also said in a statement that VastNed would probably bid for the rest of the shares.</p>
</text>
